# =============================================================================
# WOOWTECH / Woow_podman_litellm  -  environment template (COMPOSE PATH)
# WOOWTECH / Woow_podman_litellm  -  環境變數範本（Compose 部署路徑）
# =============================================================================
#
# English:
#   Copy this file to `.env`, replace every REPLACE_ME / CHANGE_ME placeholder,
#   then lock the file down:
#       cp .env.example .env
#       chmod 600 .env
#   `.env` is git-ignored. NEVER commit it. This template contains PLACEHOLDERS
#   ONLY - there is not a single real credential in this repository.
#
#   This file is for the docker-compose.yml path. It uses Compose's ${VAR}
#   interpolation conventions. The Quadlet/systemd path needs a plainer file
#   with no interpolation - see .env.quadlet.example.
#
# 中文：
#   請將本檔複製為 `.env`，把所有 REPLACE_ME / CHANGE_ME 佔位字串換成真實值，
#   然後限制檔案權限：
#       cp .env.example .env
#       chmod 600 .env
#   `.env` 已被 .gitignore 排除，絕對不要提交進版本庫。本範本只包含「佔位字串」，
#   整個儲存庫沒有任何一組真實憑證。
#
#   本檔僅適用於 docker-compose.yml 部署路徑，使用 Compose 的 ${VAR} 變數展開語法。
#   Quadlet / systemd 部署路徑需要不做任何變數展開的純 KEY=VALUE 檔案，
#   請改用 .env.quadlet.example。
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generating strong values / 產生高強度隨機值
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   LITELLM_MASTER_KEY  ->  echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"
#   LITELLM_SALT_KEY    ->  echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"
#   POSTGRES_PASSWORD   ->  openssl rand -hex 24
#
#   English: run each command once and paste the output below. Do not reuse the
#            same value for two different variables.
#   中文：每個指令各執行一次，把輸出貼到下面對應欄位。不同變數請勿共用同一組值。
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY  (REQUIRED / 必填)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: Every model in config/config.yaml routes through OpenRouter using the
#          openrouter/<vendor>/<model> slug form. config.yaml references this
#          variable indirectly as `os.environ/OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, so the key
#          never appears in any tracked file. Get one from openrouter.ai/keys.
# 中文：    config/config.yaml 中所有模型都透過 OpenRouter 轉送，使用
#          openrouter/<廠商>/<模型> 的 slug 形式。config.yaml 以
#          `os.environ/OPENROUTER_API_KEY` 間接引用本變數，因此金鑰不會出現在
#          任何進版控的檔案中。請至 openrouter.ai/keys 申請。
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-REPLACE_ME


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LITELLM_MASTER_KEY  (REQUIRED / 必填)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: The proxy admin credential. It authenticates admin API calls AND is
#          the Admin UI login password (username `admin`, password = this value,
#          at http://<host>:4000/ui). It MUST start with `sk-`.
#          Generate:  echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"
# 中文：    這是 Proxy 的管理者憑證。它同時用於管理 API 的驗證，以及 Admin UI 的
#          登入密碼（帳號 `admin`，密碼就是這個值，網址 http://<主機>:4000/ui）。
#          值必須以 `sk-` 開頭。
#          產生方式： echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=sk-REPLACE_ME


# =============================================================================
# !!  LITELLM_SALT_KEY  -  SET ONCE, NEVER ROTATE  !!
# !!  LITELLM_SALT_KEY  -  只設定一次，永遠不要更換  !!
# =============================================================================
#
# English:
#   This key encrypts every provider credential that LiteLLM stores in
#   PostgreSQL (the OpenRouter key you add through the Admin UI, MCP server
#   credentials, logging-callback credentials, and so on).
#
#   IF YOU CHANGE IT, EVERY CREDENTIAL ALREADY ENCRYPTED IN THE DATABASE BECOMES
#   PERMANENTLY UNDECRYPTABLE. There is no recovery. LiteLLM does not even crash
#   when this happens - decryption failures are non-blocking, so models simply
#   stop working and the log quietly says "Did your master_key/salt key change
#   recently?". A bad rotation is therefore very easy to miss.
#
#   SET IT EXPLICITLY BEFORE THE VERY FIRST START. If LITELLM_SALT_KEY is unset,
#   LiteLLM silently falls back to using LITELLM_MASTER_KEY as the encryption
#   key. That means (a) adding a salt key later breaks everything exactly as a
#   rotation would, and (b) rotating your master key while the salt key is unset
#   also breaks everything. Setting it from day one is the only safe state.
#
#   BACK THIS VALUE UP somewhere durable and separate from this host, alongside
#   your database backups. Losing it is equivalent to losing every stored
#   provider credential.
#
#   The supported way to change keys is the documented master-key rotation /
#   credential-migration flow, NOT editing this variable in place.
#
# 中文：
#   此金鑰用來加密 LiteLLM 寫入 PostgreSQL 的所有供應商憑證（你在 Admin UI 加入的
#   OpenRouter 金鑰、MCP server 憑證、logging callback 憑證等等）。
#
#   一旦更換，資料庫中所有已加密的憑證將「永久無法解密」，沒有任何救援手段。
#   更糟的是 LiteLLM 不會因此崩潰——解密失敗屬於非阻斷式錯誤，模型只會安靜地失效，
#   log 裡僅出現一行「Did your master_key/salt key change recently?」，
#   因此換錯金鑰極容易被忽略。
#
#   請務必在「第一次啟動之前」就明確設定。若 LITELLM_SALT_KEY 未設定，
#   LiteLLM 會安靜地改用 LITELLM_MASTER_KEY 當作加密金鑰；這代表
#   (a) 日後才補上 salt key，效果等同於更換金鑰，一樣會全毀；
#   (b) 在 salt key 未設定的情況下更換 master key，也會全毀。
#   從第一天就設定，是唯一安全的狀態。
#
#   請把這個值「備份」到本機以外、可長期保存的地方，與資料庫備份放在一起。
#   遺失它等同於遺失所有已儲存的供應商憑證。
#
#   若真的需要更換金鑰，請走官方文件的 master key rotation /
#   credential migration 流程，不要直接改這個變數。
#
#   Generate / 產生方式：  echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 32)"
# =============================================================================
LITELLM_SALT_KEY=sk-REPLACE_ME


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POSTGRES_USER  (has a safe default / 有安全預設值)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: PostgreSQL role name. `litellm` matches the k3s deployment; keeping
#          it means the same DATABASE_URL string works on both. Not a secret.
# 中文：    PostgreSQL 角色名稱。`litellm` 與 k3s 部署一致，維持相同值可讓同一組
#          DATABASE_URL 在兩邊通用。這不是機密資訊。
POSTGRES_USER=litellm


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD  (REQUIRED / 必填)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: The database password. There is NO default - docker-compose.yml uses
#          the ${VAR:?message} form so that `podman-compose up` aborts loudly
#          rather than deploying a database with a guessable password.
#          Whatever you set here MUST also appear in DATABASE_URL below.
#          Generate:  openssl rand -hex 24
#          NOTE: if the password contains any of  : / ? # [ ] @  you must
#          percent-encode it inside DATABASE_URL. Sticking to hex output avoids
#          the problem entirely.
# 中文：    資料庫密碼。沒有預設值——docker-compose.yml 使用 ${VAR:?訊息} 語法，
#          若未設定會直接讓 `podman-compose up` 失敗並顯示訊息，而不是預設一組
#          容易猜到的密碼就把資料庫開起來。
#          這裡設定的值必須與下方 DATABASE_URL 中的密碼一致。
#          產生方式： openssl rand -hex 24
#          注意：若密碼含有 : / ? # [ ] @ 等字元，在 DATABASE_URL 中必須做
#          percent-encoding。使用上述 hex 輸出即可完全避開這個問題。
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_TO_SECURE_PASSWORD


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POSTGRES_DB  (has a safe default / 有安全預設值)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: Database name. `litellm` matches k3s. Not a secret.
# 中文：    資料庫名稱。`litellm` 與 k3s 一致。這不是機密資訊。
POSTGRES_DB=litellm


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATABASE_URL  (REQUIRED / 必填)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: The connection string LiteLLM uses for virtual keys, budgets, spend
#          logs and encrypted credentials. config/config.yaml references it as
#          `os.environ/DATABASE_URL`.
#
#          The HOST PART MUST BE `litellm-postgres`. That is the container_name
#          and network alias of the postgres service, and it is also the name of
#          the headless Service in the k3s deployment - so this exact string is
#          portable across k3s, this compose stack, and the Quadlet units.
#          Do NOT use `localhost`: the two containers are in separate network
#          namespaces and talk over the bridge network's DNS.
#
#          The user / password / db name here MUST match POSTGRES_USER,
#          POSTGRES_PASSWORD and POSTGRES_DB above. They are not derived from
#          each other automatically.
# 中文：    LiteLLM 連線字串，用於虛擬金鑰、預算、花費紀錄與加密憑證。
#          config/config.yaml 以 `os.environ/DATABASE_URL` 引用。
#
#          主機名稱「必須」是 `litellm-postgres`。這是 postgres 服務的
#          container_name 與網路別名，也是 k3s 中 headless Service 的名稱，
#          因此同一組字串可在 k3s、本 compose 堆疊與 Quadlet units 之間通用。
#          請勿使用 `localhost`：兩個容器位於不同的 network namespace，
#          彼此是透過 bridge 網路的 DNS 溝通。
#
#          此處的帳號 / 密碼 / 資料庫名稱必須與上方 POSTGRES_USER、
#          POSTGRES_PASSWORD、POSTGRES_DB 一致，系統不會自動套用。
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://litellm:CHANGE_ME_TO_SECURE_PASSWORD@litellm-postgres:5432/litellm


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LITELLM_PORT  (optional / 選填, default 4000)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: Host port that the gateway is published on. The container always
#          listens on 4000 internally; this only changes the host side.
#          SECURITY: docker-compose.yml publishes on all host interfaces, which
#          puts the Admin UI and the /v1 API on your LAN. On an untrusted
#          network, edit the `ports:` mapping to "127.0.0.1:4000:4000" and put a
#          reverse proxy in front. See README Security Notes.
# 中文：    Gateway 對外發布的「主機端」連接埠。容器內部一律監聽 4000，
#          這個變數只改變主機端。
#          安全性提醒：docker-compose.yml 預設綁定所有主機網卡，等於把 Admin UI
#          與 /v1 API 曝露在整個區域網路。若處於不可信任的網路環境，請把
#          `ports:` 改成 "127.0.0.1:4000:4000"，並在前面架設反向代理。
#          詳見 README 的 Security Notes 章節。
LITELLM_PORT=4000


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STORE_MODEL_IN_DB  (optional / 選填, default True)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: When True, models and settings added through the Admin UI or the
#          /config/update API are written to PostgreSQL and survive restarts.
#          On startup the proxy loads config.yaml first and then overlays the DB
#          rows for general_settings / router_settings / litellm_settings, with
#          the DB value winning on any shared key - so editing those keys in
#          config.yaml and restarting will NOT change the running value once the
#          DB holds one. model_list is the exception: DB models are ADDED
#          alongside the YAML models rather than replacing them.
#          Matches the k3s deployment. Keep it as True.
# 中文：    設為 True 時，透過 Admin UI 或 /config/update API 新增的模型與設定會
#          寫入 PostgreSQL 並在重啟後保留。
#          啟動時 Proxy 會先讀 config.yaml，再把資料庫中的
#          general_settings / router_settings / litellm_settings 疊上去，
#          兩邊都有的鍵「以資料庫為準」——因此一旦資料庫中有值，改 config.yaml
#          再重啟並不會改變實際生效的值。model_list 是例外：資料庫中的模型是
#          「額外新增」在 YAML 模型旁邊，而不是取代它們。
#          與 k3s 部署一致，建議維持 True。
STORE_MODEL_IN_DB=True


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LITELLM_MODE  (optional / 選填, default PRODUCTION)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: PRODUCTION disables LiteLLM's internal load_dotenv(), so credentials
#          come only from the container environment and never from a stray .env
#          inside the image. That is its entire documented effect. Matches k3s.
# 中文：    設為 PRODUCTION 會停用 LiteLLM 內部的 load_dotenv()，讓憑證只來自容器
#          環境變數，不會誤讀映像檔內殘留的 .env。這就是它全部的官方定義效果。
#          與 k3s 一致。
LITELLM_MODE=PRODUCTION


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LITELLM_LOG  (optional / 選填, default INFO)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# English: Log verbosity. Documented values: DEBUG, INFO, ERROR.
#          Watch the off-by-one naming: LITELLM_LOG=INFO is the env equivalent of
#          the CLI's `--debug`, and LITELLM_LOG=DEBUG equals `--detailed_debug`.
#          ERROR is upstream's quietest production baseline; INFO is what the k3s
#          deployment uses and is kept here for parity.
# 中文：    日誌詳細程度。官方文件列出的值：DEBUG、INFO、ERROR。
#          請注意名稱錯位：LITELLM_LOG=INFO 相當於 CLI 的 `--debug`，
#          LITELLM_LOG=DEBUG 才相當於 `--detailed_debug`。
#          ERROR 是官方建議最安靜的正式環境基準；INFO 是 k3s 部署使用的值，
#          此處沿用以保持一致。
LITELLM_LOG=INFO


# =============================================================================
# DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE  (optional / 選填, default false - DO NOT COPY k3s HERE)
# =============================================================================
#
# English:
#   LEAVE THIS AT `false` FOR A NORMAL PODMAN DEPLOYMENT.
#
#   The k3s manifests set this to "true", and that is correct THERE: the schema
#   already exists in the production database, and multiple restarting or rolling
#   proxy pods must not race each other running migrations. Upstream's Helm chart
#   does the same and pairs it with a dedicated migrations Job that owns them.
#
#   This Podman stack has no migrations Job and starts against a brand-new EMPTY
#   volume. With DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE=true the proxy replaces its
#   `prisma migrate deploy` run with a read-only `prisma migrate diff` that
#   prints the SQL it would need and executes none of it. No LiteLLM table is
#   ever created, /health/readiness never reports the DB connected, and you are
#   left with an endlessly unhealthy container and a very non-obvious cause.
#
#   With `false` (LiteLLM's own default) the single proxy container migrates the
#   schema on first boot and then finds nothing to do on every later boot. This
#   topology has exactly one process that could ever migrate, so there is no race
#   to prevent.
#
#   Only set this to `true` if you have added your own separate migration step
#   (for example a one-shot container running
#   `litellm --config /app/config.yaml --skip_server_startup` with the flag
#   unset), or if you are mirroring the multi-replica k3s topology AFTER the
#   schema already exists.
#
#   Accepted truthy strings: true, 1, t, y, yes (case-insensitive).
#
# 中文：
#   一般 Podman 部署請「保持 false」。
#
#   k3s 的 manifest 把它設為 "true"，在「那邊」是正確的：正式資料庫中 schema 早已
#   存在，而多個重啟中或滾動更新中的 proxy pod 不能互相搶著跑 migration。
#   官方 Helm chart 也是這樣做，並額外搭配一個專責 migration 的 Job。
#
#   本 Podman 堆疊沒有 migration Job，而且是對著一個「全新的空 volume」啟動。
#   若把 DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE 設為 true，Proxy 會把 `prisma migrate deploy`
#   換成唯讀的 `prisma migrate diff`：它只會把需要執行的 SQL 印出來，一行都不會執行。
#   結果是所有 LiteLLM 資料表永遠不會被建立、/health/readiness 永遠不會回報
#   資料庫已連線，而你只會看到一個永遠不健康、且原因極不明顯的容器。
#
#   設為 false（也就是 LiteLLM 本身的預設值）時，唯一的 proxy 容器會在第一次啟動時
#   建立 schema，之後每次啟動都會發現沒事可做。這個架構中只有一個行程可能執行
#   migration，因此根本不存在需要避免的競爭。
#
#   只有在你自行加入了獨立的 migration 步驟（例如用同一個映像檔跑一次性容器：
#   `litellm --config /app/config.yaml --skip_server_startup`，且不設此旗標），
#   或是在 schema 已存在後要複製 k3s 的多副本架構時，才把它設為 true。
#
#   可接受的「真值」字串：true、1、t、y、yes（不分大小寫）。
# =============================================================================
DISABLE_SCHEMA_UPDATE=false


# =============================================================================
# DELIBERATELY ABSENT: TUNNEL_TOKEN / cloudflared
# 刻意不提供：TUNNEL_TOKEN / cloudflared
# =============================================================================
# English: This package ships no cloudflared container and no tunnel token.
#          NEVER paste the k3s deployment's Cloudflare tunnel token here. A
#          second connector registered with the same token becomes another
#          endpoint of that same tunnel, and Cloudflare will load-balance live
#          production traffic across both - sending an unpredictable share of it
#          to this stack. If you need a Cloudflare tunnel, create a NEW tunnel
#          with a NEW hostname and a NEW token. Reverse proxy, Tailscale and
#          firewalled port publishing are the documented alternatives.
# 中文：    本套件不含任何 cloudflared 容器，也不提供 tunnel token 變數。
#          絕對不要把 k3s 部署所使用的 Cloudflare tunnel token 貼到這裡。
#          用同一組 token 註冊第二個 connector，等於替「同一條 tunnel」新增了一個
#          端點，Cloudflare 會把正式流量在兩者之間負載平衡，讓不可預期的一部分
#          正式流量被導向本堆疊。若確實需要 Cloudflare tunnel，請另外建立
#          「新的 tunnel、新的網域名稱、新的 token」。
#          反向代理、Tailscale、以及有防火牆保護的連接埠發布，都是文件建議的替代方案。
# =============================================================================
